[Name] ELFUtils
[Summary] Utilities and libraries to read, create and modify ELF binaries (libelf, libdw, libasm)
[Description] A collection of utilities and DSOs to handle compiled objects. Provides libelf.pc, which Mesa 25.3.6 requires for the radeonsi gallium driver (meson.build: dependency('libelf'), hard error without it), plus libdw/libasm and the eu-* tools. Pinned to the ISO's own version 0.178 so making the dependency explicit does not silently upgrade the base system.
